{"id":"wb-7-265","name":"李家沟遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"李家沟遗址","text":"李家沟遗址发现于河南省新密市岳村镇李家沟村以西，该遗址是一处旧石器时代和新石器时代过渡阶段的遗址。通过发掘发现了距今10500年－8600年左右不间断的史前文化堆积。被列入了2009年度全国十大考古新发现。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E6%B2%9F%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93331613,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93331613","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c00a0088af888f8f315645d4.jpg","title":"20241018 Bone Arrowhead, Lijiagou Site.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241018_Bone_Arrowhead,_Lijiagou_Site.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/20241018_Bone_Arrowhead%2C_Lijiagou_Site.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​骨镞，新密李家沟遗址出土，旧石器时代","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Lijiagou Site","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Lijiagou_Site"}}